{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i><strong>&quot;Sometimes when you shoot for the stars, they shoot back.&quot;</strong></i><br>__</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shoot up the leaderboards in a high scoring throwback to simpler times when stars were stars, and if we needed to jump, we shot at the ground. Use pure skill to launch yourself ever upward in Classic Mode, or earn experience and unlock powerful upgrades in Rogue Mode. Super Shootin Star is the perfect game when you've only got 2 minutes to spare, and even better when you've got enough time for just one more game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4140790/extras/498fc6a39c14ac10bafbf64a3593d1d4.poster.avif?t=1763566217\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4140790/extras/498fc6a39c14ac10bafbf64a3593d1d4.webm?t=1763566217\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4140790/extras/498fc6a39c14ac10bafbf64a3593d1d4.mp4?t=1763566217\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mouse-only, 1-button controls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 game modes: A classic high-score mode that's all skill no frills, and a longer roguelike inspired mode with upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Leaderboards for local, friend list, and global competition in both game modes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >28 Steam Achievements to unlock</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short runs are perfect when you have a few minutes to spare</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Cumulative Nimbus","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4140790/d4d60ca